=== 1. Poisson and corrections for H = q*p^3, G = q^2 ===
hbar^0: -6*q^2p^2
correction-free: True

=== 2. Monomial partners of H = q*p^3, G = q^c p^d, c+d <= 6 ===
  G = q^0 p^1  correction-free
  G = q^0 p^2  correction-free
  G = q^0 p^3  correction-free
  G = q^0 p^4  correction-free
  G = q^0 p^5  correction-free
  G = q^0 p^6  correction-free
  G = q^1 p^0  correction-free
  G = q^1 p^1  correction-free
  G = q^1 p^2  correction-free
  G = q^1 p^3  correction-free
  G = q^1 p^4  correction-free
  G = q^1 p^5  correction-free
  G = q^1 p^6  correction-free
  G = q^2 p^0  correction-free
  G = q^5 p^1  correction-free

=== 3. Homogeneous kernel, H = q^4 + p^4, degree 6 ===
dimension: 3
  1/5*p^6 + q^4p^2
  qp^5 + q^5p
  5*q^2p^4 + q^6

=== 4. Homogeneous kernel, H = q^3, degree 4 (sanity / monomial sector) ===
dimension: 3
  q^2p^2
  q^3p
  q^4
